WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
The professor gives Instructor Desk the closure notice, the syllabus and their own rules.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.400
It finds every class inside the closure: two lessons and the lab.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.400
The lab moves to Thursday. Now the memo is due only 26 h 10 m later. The rule says 48 h.

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.400
It rechecks every gap with code. The memo moves to Tuesday: 123 h 10 m, PASS. A draft for the professor.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Student Helper only answers from approved answers. Something new? It won't guess.

6
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.400
The professor answers once. It's added as A11, and the next student gets it in seconds.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.800
Try it yourself: tanviranjumjoarder.github.io/OwlContinuity
